{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad Arcade is a Roguelike deck-building game where the player acquires cards, relics, and consumables to face increasingly difficult battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, the player selects a character, each with their own unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/e9cfd9830be07ccfa918a8a28cf25e20.avif?t=1759780544\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can choose which comic page to read, triggering the interactions found there\u2014whether it\u2019s battles, shops, vending machines, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/374c628966d27956c48d40059de476f1.avif?t=1759780544\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most important activity in Squad Arcade is the card duels, where the player uses their cards to create Squads that enhance their statistics to confront enemies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/6bbfcadacb895a797a59ca9010f0387a.avif?t=1759780544\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the special abilities of the most powerful characters to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/5b9afef62d15790a6fc90a48b5f9284d.avif?t=1759780544\" width=1560 height=764 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To obtain more cards, relics, or consumables that help make the Squads stronger, players can go to the shops to acquire them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/ed04e33123e3eedaa82518e79b6916f3.avif?t=1759780544\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312170?t=1759780544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312170?t=1759780544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/d70437ff8eb251a9d27cf9c39738cd7c55cbe07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759780544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/d70437ff8eb251a9d27cf9c39738cd7c55cbe07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759780544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad Arcade is a Roguelike deck-building game where the player acquires cards, relics, and consumables to face increasingly difficult battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, the player selects a character, each with their own unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312170/extras/e9cfd9830be07ccfa918a8a28cf25e20.avif?t=1759780544\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can choose which comic page to read, triggering the interactions found there\u2014whether it\u2019s battles, shops, vending machines, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://